/-!
# The six marked vertex-intersection words

The permutation indices are the genuine symmetric group on three letters.
The cubic generator maps to x and the transposition to the fixed inverter.
These finite witnesses are checked by the embedding module.
Source: Aschbacher, *Sporadic Groups*, 47.10, pp.266–267; ATLAS local words.
-/

@[expose] public section
namespace Sporadic.LeechRelated.J2.RecognitionGeometry.LocalA5.VertexData
open Theory.GroupTheory

def code (p : Equiv.Perm (Fin 3)) : Nat :=
  (p 0).val + 3*(p 1).val + 9*(p 2).val

def word (p : Equiv.Perm (Fin 3)) : List (Fin 2) :=
  match code p with
  | 5 => [0, 1]
  | 7 => [0]
  | 11 => [0, 0]
  | 15 => [1, 0]
  | 19 => [1]
  | 21 => []
  | _ => []

